[],"speaker":"C-MS","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"How dull of you! How's it possible for someone to play Knight for nine games and lose all of them?! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's basically an unspoken rule at this point—if FF FN49 gets to be the Knight, then the Villagers lose!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CBJMS","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maybe it's just a coincidence?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CBJMS","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"C-MS","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It can't be a mere coincidence! Look at this afternoon's game where FF FN49 got to be the Knight! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We Villagers lost the Seer, the Knight, and the Cupid all on the first day... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We were definitely cursed by FF FN49 as the Knight!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"???","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Putting all the blame on someone innocent... Aren't you going a bit too far?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Everyone turns at the sound of those words, only to see FAL standing at the door with her arms crossed. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"With a contemptuous and cold smirk, she locks her gaze on C-MS."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"FAL","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"FAL","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If you believe in so called fate or metaphysics, then I recommend you to leave Griffin and become some fortune-telling Doll. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Besides, I don't believe in such things like curses. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"FF FN49's zero-win streak as the Knight is as likely the result of incompetent teammates as her apparent bad luck... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Those of you who belong to the same faction, not only do you not reflect on your own mistakes and improve your own skills, but put all the blame on FF FN49 instead, and to even call it a \"curse\"... How disappointing."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"FAL slowly approaches with the aura of a confident leader, and quietly shelters FF FN49 behind her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"FN49","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,120"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"FF FN49","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Leader..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CBJMS","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"C-MS","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey, there should be a limit to how much you cover for your own squad member."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"FAL","expression":7,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"FAL","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You interrogated FF FN49 in private and without consent. That's quite unruly in itself. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm the one in charge of FN squad. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Please go away, mind your own business, and reflect on your own poor gameplay decisions."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"C-MS clenches her fists in anger."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"CBJMS","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"C-MS","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Me? Poor gameplay?! You're the ones with the worst moves.","style":{"size":"50"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, FAL knew there was a White King Lycan in the game, yet she still exposed herself as the Seer without first figuring out who the White King Lycan was! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And you, FF FN49, how dare you let Gr G36 the Cupid link you up with FAL? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Did you think we weren't dying fast enough, huh?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"spea